From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 25 Jul 2026 14:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] The Proof Lab: school tracking & revision site

Self-contained site: index.html (tracker homepage), tracker.css,
tracker-data.js (seed content), Tracker.jsx (app), plus the
colors_and_type.css tokens and MathParticles.jsx background it needs.
Assignments queue with due-date countdowns, revision canon with
reveal-proof, problem arena, margin notes, sidebar calendar, quiz
mode. KaTeX for math; live edits persist in localStorage.

---
 index.html           | 21 +
 tracker.css          | 184 +
 tracker-data.js      | 56 +
 Tracker.jsx          | 424 +
 colors_and_type.css  | 310 +
 MathParticles.jsx    | 43 +
 6 files changed, 1038 insertions(+)

diff --git a/index.html b/index.html
new file mode 100644
--- /dev/null
+++ b/index.html
@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@
+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en" data-theme="dark">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
+  <title>The Proof Lab | Dallen Lee</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="colors_and_type.css" />
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="tracker.css" />
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.css" crossorigin="anonymous" />
+  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/katex@0.16.11/dist/katex.min.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
+  <script src="https://unpkg.com/react@18.3.1/umd/react.production.min.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
+  <script src="https://unpkg.com/react-dom@18.3.1/umd/react-dom.production.min.js" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
